   5: /**
   6:  * useTypewriter â€” mÃ¡quina de escrever cÃ­clica do hero (S1+S2).
   7:  *
   8:  * Ciclo com motion permitido (comp "S1+S2 Hero Desktop 1920.dc.html"):
   9:  *   typing (90ms/char) â†’ holding (1400ms) â†’ deleting (45ms/char) â†’
  10:  *   pausa de 240ms â†’ prÃ³xima palavra â†’ loop infinito.
